    "correctChoice": "D",
    "explanation": "There are no definitive laboratory tests for ASD, but the\nfollowing tests may be done to rule out other diagnoses:\n• Hearing test (for language deficit)\n• Chromosomal testing (to identify fragile X syndrome,\ntubular sclerosis, genetic polymorphisms)\n• Congenital viral disease panel\n• Metabolic panel\nPatients with autism spectrum disorder (ASD) who present\nwith seizures, spells, or regression should undergo\nelectroencephalogram (EEG).",
