    "stem": "A 9 month old girl is brought to the ER with a 1 day\nhistory of intermittent, inconsolable crying. She\nseems comfrotable in between the attacks. She has\nvomited twice and has had one bowel movement\nthat the mother described as bloody. Based on the\nclinical presentation what is the most appropriate\ndiagnostic procedure?",
