    "id": "superexam-pediatrics-0084",
    "subject": "pediatrics",
    "originalNumber": 84,
    "stem": "4. A five year old male presents to the emergency\nroom with sudden onset right sided hemiparesis.\nTwo months ago, patient was diagnosed with iron\ndeficiency anemia and ascariasis. Which of the\nfollowing is the most likely diagnosis?",
