    "id": "superexam-pediatrics-0124",
    "subject": "pediatrics",
    "originalNumber": 124,
    "stem": "A 2-year old male presented with frequent\ncoughing and wheezing. Radiologic finding showed\na collapsed trachea. The findings are suggestive of:",
