    "subject": "pediatrics",
    "originalNumber": 127,
    "stem": "A child was delivered preterm via emergency CS to\na 35 year-old primigravid because of fetal distress.\nAt the first 5 minute of life, he was noted to have a\nheart rate of 90, cyanotic on the extremities,\nirregular respiration, weak tone, and grimaces with\nsuction. This indicates/predicts",
