    "subject": "pediatrics",
    "originalNumber": 135,
    "stem": "A 9 year old male patient was brought to your clinic\ndue to cough for more than a month accompanied\nby marked weight loss. Her mother also has\nchronic cough. If Mantoux test shows an induration\nof 10 mm, the most likely diagnosis is:",
