    "stem": "SAO, a 4 year old boy was brought to the ER due to\nbleeding from the gums, CBC was done revealing\nWBC of 35,000, ANC was 4,200, BM aspiration\nshowed >25% of BM cells are lymphoblasts, what is\nthe treatment?",
