    "stem": "KO, a 5 year old child was brought to your clinic\nbecause of fever, you noted the presence of fever at\n37.8C and swollen posterior auricular nodes\nwithout colds or photophobia, there were\nmaculopapular rashes all over the body, you know\nthat the most likely causative agent is:",
