    "id": "superexam-pediatrics-0190",
    "subject": "pediatrics",
    "originalNumber": 190,
    "stem": "8 year old male was brought to the clinic due to 3\nday history of fever and development of rashes.The\nrashes were characterized with an appearance\ndescribed as \"dewdrops on a rose petal\". Which of\nthe the following is true about the diagnosis?",
