    "originalNumber": 193,
    "stem": "A 4 years old male tripped while playing in the\nstreets. He sustained abrasions in the knees and\nforearms and his right hand was punctured by a\nfallen branch of a tree. He was brought to your\nclinic for treatment. The child is completely\nimmunized for age. After cleaning and disinfecting\nthe wound, what should be given for tetanus\nprophylaxis?",
