    "stem": "A 2 y/o male presents with rapidly enlarging\nabdominal mass. During PE, you noted that there\nwas also bilateral proptosis and echymosis of both\nperiorbital region. Neurological examination\nshowed, miosis of the right eye as well as difficulty\nin performing finger to nose test. what is the most\nlikely diagnosis?",
