    "subject": "pediatrics",
    "originalNumber": 269,
    "stem": "A 5 year old patient is brought to your clinic. Her\nparents claim that the child started to show\ndifficulty in attempting to stand from a sitting\nposition and has lordotic posturing. They can also\nrecall that they noted poor head control when he\nwas an infant. Physical examination reveals\nhypertrophy of the calf muscles. What is the\ndiagnosis?",
