    "originalNumber": 347,
    "stem": "A 3 year old girl arrives at the ER with a one day\nhistory of fever and macular rash that evolved into\npetechiae and purpura. She was hypotensive with\ncold clammy extremities. What is the most likely\ndiagnosis?",
