    "subject": "pediatrics",
    "originalNumber": 427,
    "stem": "An infant was noted to have vomiting after every\nfeeding. No other symptoms reported. Physical\nexam shows a restless tachycardic infant with a\npalpable firm, movable olive-shaped mass in the\nabdomen. Your initial impression of pyloric\nstenosis will be confirmed by:",
