    "stem": "A 5 year-old boy was brought by his mother at the\nout-patient department. He presented with a mild\nrespiratory prodrome. The initial stage was\ncharacterized with erythematous facial flushing\nlikened to a slapped cheek. The disease is most\nlikely caused by:",
