    "stem": "Jerry is a mentally retarded 4-year-old who was\nnoted to be hypotonic at birth and is noted to have\ntremendous appetite, obesity, hypogonadism and\nsmall hands and feet. The genetic mechanism\nresponsible for this syndrome is due to:",
