    "explanation": "BP= Age x 2 + 90 (upper SBP range)\nBP= Age x 2 + 70 (lower SBP range)\nTherefore, 4 x 2 + 70 and 4 x 2+90 = 78 – 98 mmHg is\nthe normal SBP range of a 4 year old child. Below\n78mmHg is already considered low.",
