    "subject": "pediatrics",
    "originalNumber": 597,
    "stem": "A 7 month old girl was brought to the emergency\nroom due to high fever. Patient had 4 days history\nof fever (38C) followed by coryza, cough and\nmaculopapular rash which started on the face and\nlater spred to the trunk and extremities. What\nvitamin deficiency is associated with increased\nmortality from this disease entity?",
