    "stem": "On physical examination, the neonate was noted to\nhave an absent Moro and Biceps reflex on the left\narm. The left arm was also noted to be abducted,\ninternally rotated, and the forearm was pronated.\nWhat birth injury does the patient most likely\nhave?",
