    "subject": "pediatrics",
    "originalNumber": 612,
    "stem": "A preterm infant, 2-hr old, was observed to have\nshallow breathing at 65 breaths/minute, with\ngrunting and cyanosis. CXR shows fine reticular\ngranularity of the parenchyma and air\nbronchograms. Which of the following should have\nbeen done to prevent this condition?",
