    "id": "superexam-pediatrics-0616",
    "subject": "pediatrics",
    "originalNumber": 616,
    "stem": "A 12-year old male with diagnosed with\nstreptococcal pharyngitis and amoxicillin was\nstarted. One hour after drug intake, he complained\nof tingling sensation around his mouth, difficulty of\nswallowing and developed hoarse voice. At the ER,\nthere was generalized urticaria, puffy eyelids,\nPR=130/min, RR=32/min, BP=70/30 and T=\n37.2˚C.The patient is experiencing this type of\nshock:",
