    "subject": "pediatrics",
    "originalNumber": 625,
    "stem": "You are called to the nursery to evaluate a male\nnewborn with cyanosis. On auscultation, you hear a\nsingle S2 but no murmur. Pulse oximetry shows an\noxygen saturation of 72 % in room air. An\nelectrocardiogram reveals left axis deviation and\nleft ventricular hypertrophy. What is his likely\ndiagnosis?",
